//! Safe, local generation and execution of a small GitHub Actions CI surface.
//!
//! The scanner reads repository metadata only. It never evaluates a build file,
//! package manifest, hook, or project command. Commands are drafted into
//! `.github/ci/project.toml`; the checked-in configuration is the runtime
//! source of truth after generation.

